<title>USA: Royal Oak, Mich., won by Hutchinson Shockey.</title>
<headline>Royal Oak, Mich., won by Hutchinson Shockey.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hutchinson Shockey said it won $5.345 million of Royal Oak, Mich., 1997 water and sewer revenue refunding bonds, with a true interest cost of 4.24 percent.</p>
